Below is a single *SEARCH/REPLACE* patch for the vector‐tile canvas renderer. What was happening is that even in `"vector"` renderMode we were still falling through to the super‐class’s `postRender`, which draws the pre‐rasterized (image) tiles on top of our freshly drawn vector fills—hence the “ghost” fill layer. We only want to invoke the `CanvasTileLayerRenderer` logic when we are *not* in vector mode.

